Meta.documentation:Number.multiply
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Multiplies every Number in the flow together.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Accumulates all incoming Numbers and emits their product when the input ends.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — each Number to multiply
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the product, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:2 Number:3 Number:4]>>Number.multiply:>>Console:
